{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About The Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bonds of the Zodiac Demo\u00a0</strong>is a first person narrative adventure game, where the player plays from the perspective of Rei, a girl who was left all alone in this world after her grandmother\u2019s passing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805720/extras/Rei_Place.gif?t=1750792690\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rei gets contacted by the spirits of Zodiac, asking her for help with breaking their bond with the Jade Emperor, who keeps them confined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805720/extras/JE_resized.png?t=1750792690\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Delve into a beautiful world of <strong>Bonds of the Zodiac </strong>, set in a rural Japanese Village and mysterious realms of the Zodiac and the Jade Emperor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805720/extras/Sceenery.gif?t=1750792690\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805720/extras/4.jpg?t=1750792690\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Meet The Spirits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805720/extras/Kadar1-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1750792690\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn about the relationships between the spirits and the Jade Emperor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover the root cause of the Zodiac rebellion and help them gain their freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Bonds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manifested as strings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find a way how to sever the first bond between the Jade Emperor and a Zodiac Spirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805720/extras/String_Cut.png?t=1750792690\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What does the demo offer?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the first arc of Bonds of the Zodiac, offering 15\u201325 minutes of captivating narrative gameplay.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3805720?t=1750792690","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805720/4967e8b92110cfdc7c7fbe7a70e464c248ef2e11/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750792690","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805720/5748a59bd7e20ce2fa52ffd9bebc6cdcdfdd05cb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750792690","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805720/5748a59bd7e20ce2fa52ffd9bebc6cdcdfdd05cb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750792690","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This demo explores matur